  "title": "Half-Red Half-Sweet Potato Salad",
  "description": "A great potato duo, sweet and red, cooked and sliced and mixed with garlic, dill pickle relish, and vinegar and oil. This delicious concoction is folded into sour cream and mayonnaise and chilled for eight hours.",
